<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle market quiet, no sales- USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle market quiet, no sales- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was quiet, with no sales slaughter steers or heifers confirmed, USDA said. Inquiry good, demand light.</p>
<p>Sales confirmed for the week to date on 8,800 cattle including 6,000 head or about 68 percent previously contracted or formulated sales.</p>
<p>Confirmed - none</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
</text>
